#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""viewme - open any Markdown file in a clean, pretty popup window.

Usage: viewme [options] FILE.md      (use "-" to read Markdown from stdin)

No third-party packages are needed: Markdown is rendered by a built-in
renderer, served from a tiny local web server, and shown in a chromium-style
"app" window (no tabs or address bar). The page reloads when the file changes.
"""

